### Create a banner draft
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/banners?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "content": {
    "code": "summer-hero",
    "type": "BANNER",
    "name": "Summer hero",
    "title": "Summer collection",
    "description": "Explore the summer collection",
    "slug": "summer-hero",
    "noIndex": true
  },
  "placement": "HOME_HERO",
  "position": 0,
  "targetKind": "URL",
  "targetValue": "/summer",
  "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
  "foregroundColor": "#111111",
  "loginTarget": "ANY",
  "countryCodes": ["SA"],
  "artwork": {
    "desktopMediaId": null,
    "mobileMediaId": null,
    "altText": "Summer collection"
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("BANNER_ID", response.body.content.id); client.global.set("BANNER_VERSION", response.body.content.version); %}

### List placement in deterministic order
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/banners?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&placement=HOME_HERO
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

### Publication without default-language desktop artwork returns 422
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/banners/{{BANNER_ID}}/lifecycle/PUBLISHED?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
If-Match: {{BANNER_VERSION}}

{}

### Cross-store lookup does not expose the banner
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/banners?store={{STORE_ID_2}}&lang={{LANG}}&placement=HOME_HERO
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
